WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:18.150
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and we just got
another full trailer for guardians of the

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:19.150
galaxy.

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:23.900
We got a nice full on look at Ronan The Accuser
and the Collector.

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:27.310
So for my bonus Marvel video this week I’m
just going to break down the new footage and

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:28.310
some of my favorite things.

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:30.050
Let’s just start with the coolest top 5
things.

00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:31.050
Number 5 - The music.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:35.160
This trailer added Spirit in the Sky and kept
the same Hooked on a Feeling from the last

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:37.710
trailer.

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:40.550
It ties into Peter Quill’s anachronistic
taste in music.

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:43.520
He listens to classic rock and flies a space
ship.

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:47.540
That as well as all of them being a bunch
of well meaning dirtbags sets this really

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:49.580
funny tone for the movie.

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:57.600
The Avengers was funny, but Guardians is going
to turn the knob to 11.

00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:00.870
It’s totally ridiculous and I can’t wait
to see it.

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:03.070
Number 4 - Groot Speaks

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:09.340
Vin Diesel estimated that he said “I Am
Groot” at least a thousand times in the

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:10.670
recording booth.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:14.710
He has a language, but only Rocket Raccoon
can understand him.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.880
It’s a lot like Han Solo and Chewbacca.

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:21.260
A really furry short Han Solo and a really
tall fibrous Chewbacca.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.410
We also got to see some of his powers.

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:27.850
He does have some unique abilities including
the ability to regrow himself from a single

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.040
piece of his skin.

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:30.540
Like a spore.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:33.860
He regenerates, because his skin and limbs
get chipped off all the time.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:37.690
That flower he handed to the girl too probably
grew off of him.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:41.110
He also popped some spikes like Wolverine
pops his claws.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:48.110
I’m really looking forward to watching him
get blown up and then regrow himself.

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:52.030
Number 3 - We got to hear Glenn Close

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:54.790
She is playing Nova Prime, the leader of the
Nova Corps.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:58.440
Think of her as like a giant step up from
Cobie Smulders in Winter Soldier.

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:01.620
She’s like the Nick Fury of the Galactic
version of SHIELD.

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:05.330
They’re really pushing John C. Reilly as
the face of the Corps in all the trailers,

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:10.300
so I’m guessing he’ll be spending way
more time with the Guardians than Glenn Close.

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:15.800
But a lot of people are wondering if there
will be any Nova as in Nova the superhero,

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:16.800
easter eggs.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:23.910
He’s not supposed to be in the movie, but
fingers crossed they include a reference or

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:26.970
two.

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:31.920
Number 2 - A full on Shot of The Collector
It’s implied that he’s working for or

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:34.280
working with Thanos in the movie.

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:37.510
Obviously because Thanos is such a huge deal
he’s probably not going to be in any of

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:38.590
these early trailers.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:43.290
But supposedly Marvel cast him and he’s
part of the story.

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:45.760
Those are all just rumors, so take that with
a grain of salt.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:48.060
The Collector will be the most visible antagonist.

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:50.750
He’s just trying to Collect all the different
infinity gems.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:53.510
He’s already got a couple of them.

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:55.830
and my number 1 moment - Ronan The Accuser

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:56.830
I’m totally digging Ronan’s look.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:05:02.600
We also got a look at the Accusser Corps.

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:10.060
Which is his army of Kree soldiers which serves
justice in their territory of the Galaxy.

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:13.900
They’re like an opposing but equal force
to the Nova Corps.

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:16.030
Lots of different galactic organizations out
there.

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:20.340
But this movie will set the stage to go way
beyond the small SHIELD earth-based stuff

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:22.820
we’ve been seeing since the First Avengers
movie.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:26.650
Ronan for the most part is an antagonist to
the Guardians, but in the comics he has worked

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:27.830
with the Guardians and the Avengers.

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:29.310
So he’s not crazy like the Collector.

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:34.840
It’s more of like a Darth Vader - Emperor
Situation.

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:38.550
Nebula, Karen Gillan’s character is a full
on villain though.

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:39.890
And I’m so excited to see her.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:42.900
She’ll also be working for the collector
with Ronan.

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:48.720
They haven’t released any details about
how this movie will tie in with Avengers 2,

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.060
which is the next movie after this.

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:52.570
Other than the macguffin of the infinity gems.

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:55.630
Avengers 3 is really when those become a big
part of the story.

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:58.490
So I’m not expecting too many Avengers shout
outs in the movie.

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:01.060
But we might get another Avengers post credits
scene.

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:05.870
Or even an Ant Man teaser, since that’s
the next movie after Avengers 2.

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:08.870
But now it’s your turn, let me know what
your favorite new thing was.

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:15.900
Groot talking or seeing the Acusser Corps?

